#: manual/qed_formal_spec_changelog.md:294
msgid "Incremental revision (tone refinement)"
msgstr "増分改訂(文体の洗練)"

#: manual/qed_formal_spec_changelog.md:296
msgid "Moves the tone of the whole text toward an academic paper style, without changing the logical content:"
