msgstr "`Authority Contract` を `Normative Scope` に改め、強い命令調の文を一部、学術的な説明文に書き直した。"

#: manual/qed_formal_spec_changelog.md:299
msgid "the opening of Part II shifts from \"implementation hooks\" framing to \"concrete realization and conformance record\" framing;"
