#: manual/qed_formal_spec_changelog.md:301
msgid "`Documentation Maintenance Notes` becomes `Concluding Remarks`, and `Near-term maintenance focus` becomes `Future refinement directions`."
msgstr "`Documentation Maintenance Notes` を `Concluding Remarks` に、`Near-term maintenance focus` を `Future refinement directions` に改めた。"

#: manual/qed_formal_spec_changelog.md:303
msgid "Unifies the tone of the appendices:"
msgstr "付録の文体を統一した。"

#: manual/qed_formal_spec_changelog.md:304
