msgstr "`Audit Scenarios` を一律に `Validation Scenarios` に改名した。"

#: manual/qed_formal_spec_changelog.md:305
msgid "the ending changes from \"required before claiming\" to \"provide structured evidence for ...\"."
msgstr "結びを「required before claiming」から「provide structured evidence for ...」に変更した。"

#: manual/qed_formal_spec_changelog.md:306
msgid "Detailed semantic consistency:"
msgstr "意味論上の細かな一貫性:"

#: manual/qed_formal_spec_changelog.md:307
