#~ msgid "QED (Quite Easy Deduction) is a theorem prover written in MoonBit with a kernel-first architecture. The MoonBit implementation provides an executable, tested trusted kernel and a controlled frontend. A Lean 4 formalization in `formal_verification/` aligns the implementation with the paper specification for semantics, audit and conformance."
